OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowery rain
OL,6,Fat first this evening will clear away
OL,7,Fto the east, leaving a mix of clear
OL,8,Fspells and the odd shower overnight. A
OL,9,Fmilder night than the previous night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FIsolated showers first thing
OL,12,FFriday morning, but dissipating under
OL,13,Fa ridge of high pressure. This leaves
OL,14,Fbrighter spells in the afternoon,
OL,15,Fespecially in the west. Temperatures
OL,16,Fwill be near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
